    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into\u00a0<i>Slash a Bit,</i> a thrilling <i>first-person, melee roguelike</i> experience with a satisfying and addictive combat system in a\u00a0<i>cassette futurism</i> world. The game emphasizes rich build variety through diverse weapons and modifications, ensuring every playthrough is fresh and engaging as you battle your way through levels filled with various enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a top agent from an agency named\u00a0<i>The Flower</i>, hack into simulations to take down a rising cyber-cult known as <i>The Withered Authority</i>.  Master dynamic melee combat with attacks, parries, and unique skills with a variety of weapons. Enhance your character with impactful mods as you battle your way through intense levels and face off against ruthless bosses. Can you stop the cult before they seize control?  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into\u00a0<i>Slash a Bit,</i> a thrilling <i>first-person, melee roguelike</i> experience with a satisfying and addictive combat system in a\u00a0<i>cassette futurism</i> world. The game emphasizes rich build variety through diverse weapons and modifications, ensuring every playthrough is fresh and engaging as you battle your way through levels filled with various enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a top agent from an agency named\u00a0<i>The Flower</i>, hack into simulations to take down a rising cyber-cult known as <i>The Withered Authority</i>.  Master dynamic melee combat with attacks, parries, and unique skills with a variety of weapons. Enhance your character with impactful mods as you battle your way through intense levels and face off against ruthless bosses. Can you stop the cult before they seize control?  </p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into deadly simulations to take down a rising cyber-cult. Master dynamic melee combat with attacks, parries, and unique skills with various weapons. Enhance yourself with impactful mods as you fight through intense levels and confront ruthless bosses. Stop the cult before they seize control!",
